# zettelkasten/ holds the vault schema template, which is *copied* into the vault root
# (~/code/Zettelkasten/AGENTS.md), never symlinked. The vault is its own git repo; a
# symlink would make its schema a dotfiles dependency.
#
# Stow only reads .stow-local-ignore from inside a package directory — the one at the
# repo root is NOT consulted when selecting packages, so `stow */` would otherwise
# symlink AGENTS.md straight into $HOME.
#
# Ignoring everything makes `stow zettelkasten` a harmless no-op.
.*
